msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAME"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:14
msgid ""
"gridsnap, gridsnap-tiler, gridsnap-daemon, gridsnap-editor, gridsnap-picker, "
"gridsnap-hotcorners, gridsnap-ctl, setup-hotkeys - window tiling into zones "
"for Cinnamon/X11"
msgstr ""
"gridsnap, gridsnap-tiler, gridsnap-daemon, gridsnap-editor, gridsnap-picker, "
"gridsnap-hotcorners, gridsnap-ctl, setup-hotkeys - 用于 Cinnamon/X11 的区域窗"
"口布局器"

#. type: SH
#: man/gridsnap.1:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "SYNOPSIS"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:19
msgid ""
"B<gridsnap-tiler> [B<--monitor> I<N>] [B<--conf> I<PATH>] {B<list> | "
"B<apply> I<ZONE> | B<move> I<DIRECTION> | B<keys> | B<arrange> | B<stack> "
"I<ZONE> | B<tabs-next> | B<undo> | B<profile>} [B<--dry-run>] [B<--verify>] "
"[B<--quiet>] ..."
msgstr ""
"B<gridsnap-tiler> [B<--monitor> I<N>] [B<--conf> I<路径>] {B<list> | "
"B<apply> I<区域> | B<move> I<方向> | B<keys> | B<arrange> | B<stack> I<区域> "
"| B<tabs-next> | B<undo> | B<profile>} [B<--dry-run>] [B<--verify>] [B<--"
"quiet>] ..."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:22
msgid ""
"B<gridsnap-daemon> [B<--conf> I<PATH>] [B<--verbose>] [B<--once>] [B<--"
"socket> I<PATH> | B<--no-socket>]"
msgstr ""
"B<gridsnap-daemon> [B<--conf> I<路径>] [B<--verbose>] [B<--once>] [B<--"
"socket> I<路径> | B<--no-socket>]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:25
msgid ""
"B<gridsnap-editor> [B<--conf> I<PATH>] [B<--monitor> I<N>] [B<--shot> "
"I<FILE.png>]"
msgstr ""
"B<gridsnap-editor> [B<--conf> I<路径>] [B<--monitor> I<N>] [B<--shot> I<文"
"件.png>]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:30
msgid ""
"B<gridsnap-picker> [B<--conf> I<PATH>] [B<--monitor> I<N>] [B<--window> "
"I<XID>] [B<--select> I<ZONE>] [B<--workspace> I<N>|current|conf] [B<--hud> "
"[B<--at> I<X,Y> | B<--follow>]] [B<--dry-run>] [B<--verify>] [B<--quiet>] "
"[B<--shot> I<FILE.png>]"
msgstr ""
"B<gridsnap-picker> [B<--conf> I<路径>] [B<--monitor> I<N>] [B<--window> "
"I<XID>] [B<--select> I<区域>] [B<--workspace> I<N>|current|conf] [B<--hud> "
"[B<--at> I<X,Y> | B<--follow>]] [B<--dry-run>] [B<--verify>] [B<--quiet>] "
"[B<--shot> I<文件.png>]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:33
msgid ""
"B<gridsnap-hotcorners> [B<--conf> I<PATH>] [B<--no-hud>] [B<--dry-run>] [B<--"
"verbose>] [B<--version>]"
msgstr ""
"B<gridsnap-hotcorners> [B<--conf> I<路径>] [B<--no-hud>] [B<--dry-run>] [B<--"
"verbose>] [B<--version>]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:37
msgid ""
"B<gridsnap-ctl> [B<--socket> I<PATH>] [B<--window> I<XID>] [B<--monitor> "
"I<N>] {B<status> | B<apply> I<ZONE> | B<reload> | B<quit>} [B<--raw>] [B<--"
"quiet>]"
msgstr ""
"B<gridsnap-ctl> [B<--socket> I<路径>] [B<--window> I<XID>] [B<--monitor> "
"I<N>] {B<status> | B<apply> I<区域> | B<reload> | B<quit>} [B<--raw>] [B<--"
"quiet>]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:39
msgid "B<setup-hotkeys> [B<--list> | B<--remove>] [B<--conf> I<PATH>]"
msgstr "B<setup-hotkeys> [B<--list> | B<--remove>] [B<--conf> I<路径>]"

#. type: SH
#: man/gridsnap.1:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:46
msgid ""
"GridSnap is a visual editor of work-area zones and a window tiler for "
"Cinnamon on X11.  A zone is defined by fractions of the monitor's work area "
"(panels excluded); a window is placed through muffin's EWMH messages with "
"window-frame compensation, so the window frame — not the client area — "
"matches the zone.  Tiling works on top of the stock window manager and does "
"not replace window management."
msgstr ""
"GridSnap 是 X11 上 Cinnamon 的区域可视化编辑器与窗口布局器。区域按显示器工作"
"区（不含面板）的比例给出，窗口通过 muffin 的 EWMH 消息放置并补偿窗框，因此与"
"区域重合的是窗框，而不是客户区。布局工作于系统自带的窗口管理器之上，不取代窗"
"口管理。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:59
msgid ""
"The package installs seven commands: B<gridsnap-tiler> (the zone tiler, "
"I<zone-tiler.py>), B<gridsnap-daemon> (auto-tiling of new windows by rules, "
"I<zone-daemon.py>), B<gridsnap-editor> (the visual zone editor, I<zone-"
"editor.py>), B<gridsnap-picker> (an overlay for picking a zone with the "
"arrow keys, I<zone-picker.py>), B<gridsnap-hotcorners> (zone highlighting "
"while dragging a window, I<zone-hotcorners.py>), B<gridsnap-ctl> (the client "
"of the daemon's IPC socket, I<gridsnap-ctl>) and B<setup-hotkeys> (Cinnamon "
"hotkeys, I<setup-hotkeys.py>).  All commands are described on this page; the "
"pages B<gridsnap-tiler>(1), B<gridsnap-daemon>(1), B<gridsnap-editor>(1), "
"B<gridsnap-picker>(1), B<gridsnap-hotcorners>(1), B<gridsnap-ctl>(1) and "
"B<setup-hotkeys>(1) are aliases of this one (roff B<.so>)."
msgstr ""
"软件包安装七个命令：B<gridsnap-tiler>（按区域布局，I<zone-tiler.py>）、"
"B<gridsnap-daemon>（按规则自动放置新窗口，I<zone-daemon.py>）、B<gridsnap-"
"editor>（区域可视化编辑器，I<zone-editor.py>）、B<gridsnap-picker>（用方向键"
"选择区域的区域选择器，I<zone-picker.py>）、B<gridsnap-hotcorners>（拖拽窗口时"
"高亮区域，I<zone-hotcorners.py>）、B<gridsnap-ctl>（守护进程 IPC 套接字的客户"
"端，I<gridsnap-ctl>）和 B<setup-hotkeys>（Cinnamon 快捷键，I<setup-"
"hotkeys.py>）。所有命令都在本页说明；B<gridsnap-tiler>(1)、B<gridsnap-"
"daemon>(1)、B<gridsnap-editor>(1)、B<gridsnap-picker>(1)、B<gridsnap-"
"hotcorners>(1)、B<gridsnap-ctl>(1) 和 B<setup-hotkeys>(1) 是本页的别名（roff "
"B<.so>）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:63
msgid ""
"X11 and an EWMH-compatible window manager (Cinnamon/muffin) are required; "
"under Wayland without XWayland tiling does not work. Hotkeys and the editor "
"are part of Cinnamon."
msgstr ""
"需要 X11 和兼容 EWMH 的窗口管理器（Cinnamon/muffin）；在没有 XWayland 的 "
"Wayland 下布局无法工作。快捷键和编辑器是 Cinnamon 的一部分。"

#. type: SH
#: man/gridsnap.1:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "COMMANDS"
msgstr "命令"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "gridsnap-tiler — the tiler"
msgstr "gridsnap-tiler —— 布局器"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:67
msgid ""
"The main command: reads I<zones.conf> and moves windows. The first argument "
"is the command."
msgstr "主命令：读取 I<zones.conf> 并移动窗口。第一个参数是子命令。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:67 man/gridsnap.1:247
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<list>"
msgstr "B<list>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:72
msgid ""
"Prints the monitor's work area (B<--monitor>, 0 by default) and, for every "
"zone, its pixel frame as I<x=… y=… WxH>; the zones go in alphabetical order. "
"Does not touch windows."
msgstr ""
"打印显示器的工作区（B<--monitor>，默认 0），以及每个区域的像素边框，格式为 "
"I<x=… y=… 宽x高>；区域按字母顺序排列。不移动窗口。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:72 man/gridsnap.1:390
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<apply >I<ZONE>"
msgstr "B<apply >I<区域>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:82
msgid ""
"Puts a window into a zone: the active one by default, B<--window> I<XID> "
"sets the window by hand.  The window's maximization and fullscreen state are "
"cleared, then I<_NET_MOVERESIZE_WINDOW> is sent; the window frame is "
"compensated via I<_NET_FRAME_EXTENTS>.  B<--dry-run> only prints the frame, "
"does not move the window and writes no history.  B<--verify> re-reads the "
"actual geometry through B<xwininfo>(1) and appends \"matches the zone\" or "
"\"does not match!\". A successful B<apply> (except with B<--dry-run>) is "
"recorded in the history for B<undo>."
msgstr ""
"把窗口放入区域：默认是活动窗口，B<--window> I<XID> 可手工指定窗口。窗口先去掉"
"最大化和全屏，然后发送 I<_NET_MOVERESIZE_WINDOW>；窗框按 "
"I<_NET_FRAME_EXTENTS> 补偿。B<--dry-run> 只打印边框，不移动窗口，也不写入历"
"史。B<--verify> 通过 B<xwininfo>(1) 重新读取实际几何，并追加「与区域一致」或"
"「与区域不一致！」。成功的 B<apply>（B<--dry-run> 除外）写入 B<undo> 的历史。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:82 man/gridsnap.1:395
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<focus [>I<ZONE>B<]>"
msgstr "B<focus [>I<区域>B<]>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:98
msgid ""
"\"Only this zone\" mode: the active window (B<--window> I<XID> sets the "
"window by hand) is put into the zone, and the other windows I<of the same "
"workspace and monitor> are minimized (I<WM_CHANGE_STATE> with the value "
"I<IconicState>). Without a zone the window stays where it is — the mode then "
"means \"only this window\". A repeated B<focus> while the mode is active "
"leaves it and restores I<only those> windows that the mode minimized "
"(I<_NET_ACTIVE_WINDOW>, the target last); windows minimized by hand stay "
"minimized, and windows under B<[ignore]> and utility types (dialogs, "
"splash)  are neither minimized nor in the way. B<--off> is an explicit exit "
"for scripts and a second key. B<--dry-run> prints what would be done without "
"moving anything. The mode lives on its own workspace and is not lifted by "
"switching workspaces (restoring is possible only on the active workspace), "
"and it turns itself off only when the target window closes **while the "
"daemon is running**; leaving works from any workspace — the command switches "
"to the mode's workspace itself and restores the windows."
msgstr ""
"「只留这个区域」模式：活动窗口（B<--window> I<XID> 可手工指定窗口）放入区域，"
"同时 I<同一工作桌面和显示器> 上的其余窗口被最小化（I<WM_CHANGE_STATE>，值为 "
"I<IconicState>）。不给区域时窗口留在原处——此时模式意为「只留这个窗口」。模式"
"已激活时再次执行 B<focus> 会退出模式，并且只展开 I<由模式最小化的那些> 窗口"
"（I<_NET_ACTIVE_WINDOW>，目标窗口最后）；手工最小化的窗口保持最小化，"
"B<[ignore]> 下的窗口和特殊类型（对话框、splash）既不最小化也不妨碍操作。B<--"
"off> 是给脚本和第二个按键的显式退出。B<--dry-run> 打印将会做什么，不移动任何"
"东西。模式属于它所在的工作桌面，切换桌面不会解除（只有活动桌面上才能展开），"
"而 **在守护进程运行时** 只有目标窗口关闭才会自行结束；退出可在任意桌面进行——"
"命令自己切到模式所在的桌面并展开窗口。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:103
msgid ""
"With B<gridsnap-daemon> running, the command hands the work over to it over "
"IPC (if the socket answers): only the daemon catches windows that appeared "
"after the mode was entered. Without the daemon the mode works once, and the "
"list of minimized windows is kept in I<$XDG_STATE_HOME/gridsnap/focus.json>."
msgstr ""
"B<gridsnap-daemon> 运行时，命令通过 IPC 把工作交给它（若套接字有回应）：只有"
"守护进程会补处理模式激活后出现的窗口。没有守护进程时模式是一次性的，最小化列"
"表保存在 I<$XDG_STATE_HOME/gridsnap/focus.json> 中。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:103
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<keys>"
msgstr "B<keys>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:108
msgid ""
"Prints \"zone, tab, hotkey\" triples from the B<[keys]> section. This is the "
"source for B<setup-hotkeys>. A zone from B<[keys]> that is not in B<[zones]> "
"is skipped with a message on stderr."
msgstr ""
"打印 B<[keys]> 段中的「区域、制表符、快捷键」三元组。这是 B<setup-hotkeys> 的"
"来源。B<[keys]> 中在 B<[zones]> 里不存在的区域会被跳过，并在 stderr 给出消"
"息。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<arrange>"
msgstr "B<arrange>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:114
msgid ""
"Takes the client windows from the EWMH list I<_NET_CLIENT_LIST> and lays "
"them out into zones.  Only movable windows are moved: a non-empty "
"I<WM_CLASS> is required; dialogs, splash and other utility types, as well as "
"windows under B<[ignore]>, are left alone. The mode is chosen by B<--by>:"
msgstr ""
"从 EWMH 列表 I<_NET_CLIENT_LIST> 取客户端窗口并按区域排布。只有可移动的窗口会"
"被移动：需要非空的 I<WM_CLASS>；对话框、splash 及其他特殊类型，以及 "
"B<[ignore]> 下的窗口都不动。模式由 B<--by> 选择："

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:115
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<auto>"
msgstr "B<auto>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:120
msgid ""
"(the default) first the windows for which a B<[rules]> rule matched, then "
"the windows without a rule fill the free (not taken by a rule) zones in file "
"order; extra windows stay where they are."
msgstr ""
"（默认）先放命中 B<[rules]> 规则的窗口，然后无规则的窗口按顺序填充空闲的（未"
"被规则占用的）区域，区域按文件顺序；多余的窗口留在原处。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:120
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<rules>"
msgstr "B<rules>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:124
msgid ""
"Only windows with a matched rule, each into its own zone; the rest are left "
"alone."
msgstr "只放命中规则的窗口，各自进入自己的区域；其余窗口不动。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:124
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<order>"
msgstr "B<order>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:129
msgid ""
"All movable windows in I<_NET_CLIENT_LIST> order (bottom to top) get zones "
"in the order of the B<[zones]> section; if there are more windows than "
"zones, the extras get the last zone and become tabs there."
msgstr ""
"所有可移动窗口按 I<_NET_CLIENT_LIST> 顺序（从下到上）依次获得 B<[zones]> 段顺"
"序的区域；窗口多于区域时，多出的窗口落到最后一个区域，并以标签页形式停在那"
"里。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:140
msgid ""
"Every window is placed on the monitor it is on. Several windows that land in "
"one zone of one monitor get a shared tab frame: the zone minus a tab strip "
"of B<[tabs] height> (22 px by default). The first window of the list is the "
"bottom tab, the last one the top; a single window in a zone takes exactly "
"the zone, without the strip. The strip with the titles is drawn by I<zone-"
"tabstrip.py> (the daemon starts it); clicking a tab and B<tabs-next> switch "
"the windows of the zone. The previous frames are written to history. B<--dry-"
"run> prints I<window -E<gt> zone: x=… y=… WxH> and moves nothing.  If there "
"are no suitable windows, the command exits successfully."
msgstr ""
"每个窗口放在它所在的显示器上。落入同一显示器同一区域的多个窗口获得共同的标签"
"页边框：区域减去高度为 B<[tabs] height>（默认 22 px）的标签栏。列表中第一个窗"
"口是底部标签页，最后一个是顶部；区域里只有一个窗口时严格按区域放置，不留标签"
"栏。带标题的标签栏由 I<zone-tabstrip.py> 绘制（由守护进程启动），点击标签页"
"和 B<tabs-next> 切换区域内的窗口。原来的边框写入历史。B<--dry-run> 打印 I<窗"
"口 -E<gt> 区域: x=… y=… 宽x高>，不移动任何东西。没有合适的窗口时命令成功结"
"束。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:146
msgid ""
"When a daemon is running, the daemon applies the layout: the command decides "
"which windows go where and writes the B<undo> history, while the daemon "
"moves the windows, updates its tracker and sends I<window-moved> to "
"subscribers. With B<--dry-run> and B<--verify> there is no delegation: those "
"modes stay local."
msgstr ""
"守护进程运行时由它来应用布局：命令算出哪些窗口放到哪里并写入 B<undo> 历史，而"
"守护进程移动窗口、更新自己的跟踪器并向订阅者发送 I<window-moved>。带 B<--dry-"
"run> 和 B<--verify> 时不委托：这些模式仍在本地执行。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:146
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<stack >I<ZONE>"
msgstr "B<stack >I<区域>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:151
msgid ""
"A special case of B<arrange>: collects all movable client windows into one "
"zone of the monitor (B<--monitor>, 0 by default) as tabs — onto the shared "
"tab frame, like B<arrange>.  A single window is placed exactly on the zone."
msgstr ""
"B<arrange> 的特例：把显示器的（B<--monitor>，默认 0）所有可移动客户端窗口以标"
"签页形式收到同一个区域——共同使用标签页边框，与 B<arrange> 相同。只有一个窗口"
"时严格按区域放置。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:151
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<tabs-next>"
msgstr "B<tabs-next>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:160
msgid ""
"Raises the next tab of the active window's zone. The command lays nothing "
"out itself; it sends a request to B<gridsnap-daemon> through its IPC socket: "
"the daemon owns the tabs, it alone knows which windows stand on the shared "
"frame. The order is bottom to top; from the top tab switching wraps to the "
"bottom one. A window outside zones and a single window are a quiet no-op "
"(code 0), while a daemon that is not running gives a message on stderr and "
"code 1. Usually bound to the hotkey from the B<[tabs]> section."
msgstr ""
"提升活动窗口所在区域的下一个标签页。命令自己不排布任何东西，而是通过 IPC 套接"
"字向 B<gridsnap-daemon> 发送请求：标签页的主人是守护进程，只有它知道哪些窗口"
"在共用边框上。顺序是从下到上；在顶部标签页时切换回到最下面的。窗口不在任何区"
"域以及区域内只有一个窗口时是静默 no-op（返回码 0），而守护进程未运行时在 "
"stderr 给消息并返回 1。通常绑定在 B<[tabs]> 段的快捷键上。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:160
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<action >I<NAME>"
msgstr "B<action >I<名称>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:173
msgid ""
"Runs the action from the B<[action:E<lt>nameE<gt>]> section — the thing "
"bound to a key.  The action receives a window and a zone: the window is the "
"active one (B<--window> I<XID> sets it by hand), and the zone comes from the "
"record's B<zone> field; without it the zone is the one whose frame (or tab "
"frame) the window is standing in (outside zones — none). The window of the "
"subject zone is the active one if it stands there, otherwise the topmost by "
"I<_NET_CLIENT_LIST>; an empty zone means no window.  The screen is B<--"
"monitor>, otherwise the window's screen, otherwise the first one; the grid "
"is the screen profile (B<[monitors]>), then the workspace one "
"(B<[workspaces]>), then I<zones.conf>, as with B<apply>/B<stack>. A record's "
"zone that is not in the grid is a config error (code 3)."
msgstr ""
"执行 B<[action:E<lt>名称E<gt>]> 段中的动作——即绑定在按键上的东西。动作会拿到"
"窗口和区域：窗口是活动窗口（B<--window> I<XID> 可手工指定），区域取自记录的 "
"B<zone> 字段；没有该字段时，取窗口所在边框（或标签页边框）对应的区域（不在区"
"域内则没有）。对象区域的窗口：若它就在那里则为活动窗口，否则取 "
"I<_NET_CLIENT_LIST> 中最上面的；区域为空则没有窗口。屏幕取 B<--monitor>，否则"
"取窗口所在屏幕，否则取第一个；网格取屏幕方案（B<[monitors]>），然后桌面"
"（B<[workspaces]>），然后 I<zones.conf>，与 B<apply>/B<stack> 相同。记录中的"
"区域不在网格里属于配置错误（返回码 3）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:182
msgid ""
"What the action receives: the window, the zone, its pixel frame, the "
"monitor, the workspace, the window's class and title, the config path — as "
"environment variables I<GRIDSNAP_*> (I<GRIDSNAP_WINDOW>, I<GRIDSNAP_ZONE>, "
"I<GRIDSNAP_X>, I<GRIDSNAP_Y>, I<GRIDSNAP_W>, I<GRIDSNAP_H>, "
"I<GRIDSNAP_MONITOR>, I<GRIDSNAP_WORKSPACE>, I<GRIDSNAP_CLASS>, "
"I<GRIDSNAP_TITLE>, I<GRIDSNAP_CONF>) and as I<{zone}>/I<{window}>/I<{x}>… "
"substitutions in the command's arguments. The config path in the command is "
"absolute: the action is started not by the CLI but by a foreign process."
msgstr ""
"动作获得的输入：窗口、区域、它的像素边框、显示器、桌面、窗口类和标题、配置文"
"件路径，以环境变量 I<GRIDSNAP_*>（I<GRIDSNAP_WINDOW>、I<GRIDSNAP_ZONE>、"
"I<GRIDSNAP_X>、I<GRIDSNAP_Y>、I<GRIDSNAP_W>、I<GRIDSNAP_H>、"
"I<GRIDSNAP_MONITOR>、I<GRIDSNAP_WORKSPACE>、I<GRIDSNAP_CLASS>、"
"I<GRIDSNAP_TITLE>、I<GRIDSNAP_CONF>）以及命令参数中的 I<{zone}>/I<{window}>/"
"I<{x}>… 占位符给出。命令中的配置路径是绝对路径：启动动作的不是 CLI，而是别的"
"进程。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:187
msgid ""
"A custom command (B<run> without I<builtin:>) is parsed by B<shlex> and "
"started B<without a shell and without waiting> (I<start_new_session>): a key "
"must not be bound to a terminal that lives until the window closes. If you "
"need a shell, write I<sh -c \"…\"> yourself. Built-in actions (B<run = "
"builtin:E<lt>nameE<gt>>):"
msgstr ""
"自定义命令（B<run> 不带 I<builtin:>）由 B<shlex> 解析，并 B<不经过 shell、不"
"等待>（I<start_new_session>）地启动：不能把按键绑到会活到窗口关闭为止的终端"
"上。需要 shell 时请自己写 I<sh -c \"…\">。内置动作（B<run = builtin:E<lt>名称"
"E<gt>>）："

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:188
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<minimize-others>"
msgstr "B<minimize-others>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:194
msgid ""
"The same mode as B<focus>: the window into the record's zone (no B<zone> — "
"\"only this window\"), the other windows of the workspace and monitor "
"minimized, a repeated press restores them.  With a live daemon the daemon "
"owns the mode."
msgstr ""
"与 B<focus> 相同的模式：窗口进入记录中的区域（没有 B<zone> 时是「只留这个窗"
"口」），桌面和显示器上的其余窗口被最小化，再按一次则恢复。守护进程运行时由它"
"掌管该模式。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:194
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<show-window>"
msgstr "B<show-window>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:200
msgid ""
"Show a window of the zone: raises and restores the window "
"(I<_NET_ACTIVE_WINDOW>); for a stack, the neighbour on the ring next to the "
"active one. No zone or an empty zone — a quiet no-op (code 0) with a message "
"on stderr."
msgstr ""
"显示区域中的窗口：提升并展开窗口（I<_NET_ACTIVE_WINDOW>），在窗口堆叠中取活动"
"窗口按环形顺序的邻居。区域不存在或为空时是静默 no-op（返回码 0），并在 "
"stderr 给消息。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:200
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<mirror>"
msgstr "B<mirror>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:209
msgid ""
"Swaps windows with the mirror zone: the mirror is found by geometry (by the "
"record's B<axis>, I<horizontal> by default — left↔right), not by name. The "
"window of the subject zone goes into the mirror zone, the mirror's window "
"comes back; an empty zone reduces the swap to moving one window, both empty "
"— no-op. Every zone gets a frame according to the number of windows now in "
"it (the tab strip), and the previous frames are written to history for "
"B<undo>. No mirror zone — code 1."
msgstr ""
"与镜像区域交换窗口：镜像按几何查找（按记录的 B<axis> 轴，默认 I<horizontal>——"
"左右），而不是按名称。对象区域的窗口去镜像区域，镜像区域的窗口回来；一侧为空"
"时交换退化为一个窗口搬家，两侧都空则是 no-op。每个区域按其中窗口数量设置边框"
"（标签栏），原来的边框写入 B<undo> 的历史。没有镜像区域时返回码 1。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:209
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<terminal>"
msgstr "B<terminal>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:218
msgid ""
"A terminal in a zone: the command from the record's B<command> field (I<x-"
"terminal-emulator> by default, substitutions work) is started detached, the "
"new window is looked for in I<_NET_CLIENT_LIST> for up to ~5 seconds and "
"placed into the zone with a frame for the number of windows plus one. The "
"zone must be set in the record (otherwise code 1 with a hint); if no window "
"appeared — code 1 too. The frame is set even when the daemon has already "
"placed the window by B<[rules]>: the action has the last word."
msgstr ""
"区域中的终端：记录里 B<command> 字段的命令（默认 I<x-terminal-emulator>，占位"
"符可用）以脱离方式启动，新窗口在 I<_NET_CLIENT_LIST> 中查找最多约 5 秒，然后"
"按「窗口数加一」的边框放入区域。区域必须在记录中给出（否则返回 1 并附提示），"
"窗口没出现也返回 1。即使窗口已经被守护进程按 B<[rules]> 放置，边框也会重设："
"最后说话的是动作。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:225
msgid ""
"B<--dry-run> prints the parsed context (window, zone, frame, monitor, "
"workspace) and the plan: for a built-in — what it would do, for a command — "
"the ready I<argv>; nothing is started or moved. Codes: 3 — no such action, a "
"broken field, an unknown substitution; 1 — a refusal on state (no mirror "
"zone, the terminal did not appear); 0 — success and an honest no-op."
msgstr ""
"B<--dry-run> 打印解析后的上下文（窗口、区域、边框、显示器、桌面）和计划：内置"
"动作打印它将做什么，自定义命令打印准备好的 I<argv>；不启动、不移动任何东西。"
"返回码：3——没有该动作、字段损坏、未知占位符；1——因状态被拒（没有镜像区域、终"
"端没有出现）；0——成功或诚实的 no-op。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:225
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<undo>"
msgstr "B<undo>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:236
msgid ""
"Returns windows to their previous frames from the history: without flags — "
"the last operation, with B<--all> — the whole history, and for every window "
"the frame is taken from the earliest operation it appears in. Before "
"restoring, the window's current I<WM_CLASS> is compared with the recorded "
"one: if the XID has been reused by another application or the window is "
"gone, it is skipped (that is not an error).  Only geometry is restored, not "
"the maximized state; the workspace is remembered, but windows are not moved "
"between workspaces. The rolled-back operation is removed from the history "
"(B<--all> clears the history). An empty history is a success."
msgstr ""
"把窗口恢复到历史中的原有边框：不带标志时恢复最后一次操作，B<--all> 恢复整个历"
"史，且每个窗口取它出现的最早那次操作中的边框。恢复前会把窗口当前的 "
"I<WM_CLASS> 与记录的比对：如果 XID 被别的程序复用或窗口已不存在，该窗口被跳过"
"（这不算错误）。只恢复几何，不恢复最大化状态；工作桌面会被记住，但窗口不会在"
"工作桌面之间移动。已回滚的操作从历史中移除（B<--all> 清空历史）。历史为空也算"
"成功。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:236
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<profile >I<ACTION>B< [>I<NAME>B<]>"
msgstr "B<profile >I<操作>B< [>I<名称>B<]>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:246
msgid ""
"Layout profiles: a complete set of zones, rules, exclusions and hotkeys. A "
"profile is a separate file I<E<lt>templatesE<gt>/E<lt>nameE<gt>.conf>; it "
"contains only the B<[zones]> section (with the bindings from B<[keys]>), "
"B<[rules]> and B<[ignore]>, without B<[grid]> and B<[daemon]>. The name is "
"sanitized by the same rule as zone names; the path cannot leave the profiles "
"directory. An action takes no more words than described below: an extra "
"argument is an error (code 2); the profile name is set by B<--name>, and the "
"second word of B<export> is a file."
msgstr ""
"布局方案：一整套区域、规则、排除项和快捷键。方案是单独的文件 "
"I<E<lt>templatesE<gt>/E<lt>名称E<gt>.conf>；其中只包含 B<[zones]>（连同来自 "
"B<[keys]> 的绑定）、B<[rules]> 和 B<[ignore]> 段，不含 B<[grid]> 和 "
"B<[daemon]>。名称用与区域名相同的规则清洗；路径不能超出方案目录。操作不接受比"
"下面描述的更多的词：多余的参数是错误（代码 2）；方案名称由 B<--name> 指定，"
"而 B<export> 的第二个词是文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:250
msgid "Names of saved profiles in alphabetical order."
msgstr "按字母顺序列出已保存的方案名称。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:250
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<show >I<NAME>"
msgstr "B<show >I<名称>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:253
msgid "The contents of the profile file verbatim."
msgstr "逐字输出方案文件的内容。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:253
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<save >I<NAME>"
msgstr "B<save >I<名称>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:258
msgid ""
"Save the zones of the current I<zones.conf> (with their bindings), its "
"B<[rules]> and B<[ignore]> as a profile.  An empty set of zones is not saved "
"(code 2)."
msgstr ""
"把当前 I<zones.conf> 的区域（连同绑定）、它的 B<[rules]> 和 B<[ignore]> 保存"
"为方案。空的区域集合不保存（返回码 2）。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:258
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<use >I<NAME>"
msgstr "B<use >I<名称>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:265
msgid ""
"Overwrite in the active I<zones.conf> the B<[zones]>, B<[rules]>, "
"B<[ignore]> and B<[keys]> sections with the profile's contents, keeping "
"B<[grid]>, B<[daemon]> and the other sections. After writing, B<setup-"
"hotkeys.py> is started with the same B<--conf> so that the new hotkeys work; "
"B<--no-hotkeys> turns that off."
msgstr ""
"用方案的内容覆盖活动 I<zones.conf> 中的 B<[zones]>、B<[rules]>、B<[ignore]> "
"和 B<[keys]> 段，保留 B<[grid]>、B<[daemon]> 及其他段。写入后以相同的 B<--"
"conf> 启动 B<setup-hotkeys.py>，让新快捷键生效；B<--no-hotkeys> 关闭这一行"
"为。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:265
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<use-monitors>"
msgstr "B<use-monitors>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:272
msgid ""
"Assemble the active I<zones.conf> from the B<[monitors]> bindings: the "
"B<[zones]> of the first screen plus the B<[zones:E<lt>outputE<gt>]> of the "
"others, merging B<[rules]>, B<[ignore]> and B<[keys]>.  This is how the "
"screen grid is applied at session start; B<--dry-run> prints the config "
"without writing anything."
msgstr ""
"从 B<[monitors]> 绑定组装活动 I<zones.conf>：第一个屏幕的 B<[zones]> 加上其余"
"屏幕的 B<[zones:E<lt>输出E<gt>]>，并合并 B<[rules]>、B<[ignore]> 和 "
"B<[keys]>。登录会话时就用它套用屏幕网格；B<--dry-run> 只打印配置，什么都不"
"写。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:272
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<rm >I<NAME>"
msgstr "B<rm >I<名称>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:275
msgid "Delete the profile."
msgstr "删除方案。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:275
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<export >I<NAME>B< [>I<FILE>B<]>"
msgstr "B<export >I<名称>B< [>I<文件>B<]>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:280
msgid ""
"Dump the profile to portable JSON (I<gridsnap_profile>: 1) — as a file or to "
"stdout.  Without a file — to stdout, if B<--json> is given; both at once is "
"an error (code 2)."
msgstr ""
"把方案导出为可移植 JSON（I<gridsnap_profile>: 1）——写入文件或输出到 stdout。"
"没有文件时若有 B<--json> 就输出到 stdout；两者同时给出是错误（返回码 2）。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:280
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<import >I<FILE>"
msgstr "B<import >I<文件>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:285
msgid ""
"Load a JSON profile into I<E<lt>templatesE<gt>/E<lt>nameE<gt>.conf>; the "
"name is taken from the JSON, and B<--name> I<NAME> overrides it. The main "
"format remains I<.conf>: JSON is only a portable exchange between machines."
msgstr ""
"把 JSON 方案载入 I<E<lt>templatesE<gt>/E<lt>名称E<gt>.conf>；名称取自 JSON，"
"B<--name> I<名称> 可以覆盖它。主要格式仍是 I<.conf>：JSON 只用于机器之间的可"
"移植交换。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:285
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<gallery>"
msgstr "B<gallery>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:289
msgid ""
"List the ready-made layouts shipped with the package: id, title, number of "
"zones and description, one per line; B<--json> prints the same in JSON."
msgstr ""
"列出安装包自带的现成布局：id、名称、区域数和说明，每行一个；B<--json> 以 "
"JSON 输出同样的内容。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:289
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<from-gallery >I<ID>"
msgstr "B<from-gallery >I<ID>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:294
msgid ""
"Copy layout I<ID> into your profile: the name is set by B<--name> I<NAME>, "
"by default the layout's id. If the name is taken it is an error: choose "
"another name or remove the profile (B<profile rm>)."
msgstr ""
"把布局 I<ID> 复制到自己的方案中：名称由 B<--name> I<名称> 指定，默认是布局的 "
"id。名称已被占用就是错误：请换一个名称或删除该方案（B<profile rm>）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:302
msgid ""
"Layouts live in I<E<lt>prefixE<gt>/share/gridsnap/gallery> (in a checkout — "
"the I<gallery/> directory next to the code); the I<GRIDSNAP_GALLERY> "
"variable sets a custom directory.  A layout file is an ordinary I<.conf> "
"with an extra B<[gallery]> section: I<title>, I<description> and an optional "
"I<order> (position in the menu, 100 by default). The gallery directory is "
"never modified: the layout is copied into the profile and lives its own life "
"from then on. In the editor the same is done by the “From gallery…” button."
msgstr ""
"布局放在 I<E<lt>前缀E<gt>/share/gridsnap/gallery>（在代码检出处——代码旁的 "
"I<gallery/> 目录），自定义目录由 I<GRIDSNAP_GALLERY> 变量指定。布局文件就是普"
"通的 I<.conf>，只是多一个 B<[gallery]> 段：I<title>、I<description> 和可选的 "
"I<order>（菜单中的顺序，默认 100）。模板库目录不会被修改：布局会被复制到方案"
"中，之后就像自己的方案一样。在编辑器里，同样的操作由「从模板库…」按钮完成。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:303
#, no-wrap
msgid "gridsnap-daemon — auto-tiling of new windows"
msgstr "gridsnap-daemon —— 自动放置新窗口"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:313
msgid ""
"An optional long-lived daemon: it subscribes to I<PropertyNotify> on "
"I<_NET_CLIENT_LIST> on the root, reads the list through B<xprop>(1) B<-root> "
"and brings the layout into line. Windows that appear are placed by the "
"B<[rules]> rules on the monitor they are on; windows that disappear are "
"dropped from bookkeeping. Utility window types and everything matched by "
"B<[ignore]> are left alone. The daemon remembers the frame it placed in "
"I<$XDG_STATE_HOME/gridsnap/placed.json>: if the user has carried a window "
"out of a zone, the daemon does not return it there again, even after a "
"restart."
msgstr ""
"可选的长期运行守护进程：订阅 root 上 I<_NET_CLIENT_LIST> 的 "
"I<PropertyNotify>，通过 B<xprop>(1) B<-root> 读取列表，并使布局与之保持一致。"
"新出现的窗口按 B<[rules]> 规则放到它们所在的显示器上；消失的窗口从记录中移"
"除。特殊窗口类型和所有命中 B<[ignore]> 的窗口都不移动。守护进程把摆放的边框记"
"在 I<$XDG_STATE_HOME/gridsnap/placed.json> 中：如果用户把窗口移出区域，即使重"
"启之后守护进程也不会再把它放回去。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:319
msgid ""
"With B<[daemon] reflow = neighbors> the freed zone is expanded by a "
"neighbouring occupied zone within the same monitor, and when a window comes "
"into it by rule again, the neighbour returns to its original frame. A "
"minimized window does not disappear from I<_NET_CLIENT_LIST>, so reflow does "
"not trigger."
msgstr ""
"在 B<[daemon] reflow = neighbors> 时，空出来的区域由同一显示器内相邻的已占用"
"区域扩展，而当窗口按规则重新进入该区域时，邻居回到原来的边框。最小化的窗口不"
"会从 I<_NET_CLIENT_LIST> 消失，因此 reflow 不会触发。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:325
msgid ""
"By default the daemon raises an IPC socket (B<--socket> I<PATH> changes the "
"path, B<--no-socket> turns IPC off). B<--verbose> prints what the daemon "
"does.  B<--once> processes one window-list change and exits; if no event "
"came, it waits 2 seconds and exits (for smoke checks). Stop with Ctrl-C "
"(B<SIGINT>) or B<gridsnap-ctl quit>."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下守护进程会启动 IPC 套接字（B<--socket> I<路径> 改变路径，B<--no-"
"socket> 关闭 IPC）。B<--verbose> 打印守护进程在做什么。B<--once> 处理一次列表"
"变化后退出；若没有等到事件，则等待 2 秒后退出（用于快速验证）。停止方式为 "
"Ctrl-C（B<SIGINT>）或 B<gridsnap-ctl quit>。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:334
msgid ""
"The daemon also runs \"only this zone\" mode (the IPC command B<focus>): the "
"window is put into the zone and the other windows of its workspace and "
"monitor are minimized; windows that appear while the mode is already active "
"are minimized by the daemon at once. Switching workspaces does not lift the "
"mode (restoring is possible only on the active workspace); it is lifted by a "
"repeated command, by the target disappearing and by the daemon terminating; "
"the un-restored remainder is written by the daemon to the mode's state file, "
"from where B<gridsnap-tiler focus --off> finishes the job."
msgstr ""
"守护进程也掌管「只留这个区域」模式（IPC 命令 B<focus>）：窗口放入区域，它的桌"
"面和显示器上的其余窗口被最小化；模式激活后出现的窗口由守护进程立即最小化。切"
"换工作桌面不会解除模式（只有活动桌面上才能展开），解除方式是重复命令、目标消"
"失和守护进程退出；未能展开的剩余部分由守护进程写入模式状态文件，再由 "
"B<gridsnap-tiler focus --off> 收尾。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:334
#, no-wrap
msgid "gridsnap-editor — the visual zone editor"
msgstr "gridsnap-editor —— 区域可视化编辑器"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:346
msgid ""
"A GTK 3 window with the monitor's work area at natural scale. A zone can be "
"dragged with the mouse and pulled by an edge or a corner; snapping is to the "
"screen edges, to neighbouring zones and to the 1/4, 1/3, 1/2, 2/3, 3/4 "
"lines. A double click on empty space creates a zone, I<Delete> deletes it; "
"there are layout templates (2 columns, 1 + 2, 2 × 2, 3 columns, main + "
"stack, blank canvas), a name and a hotkey for every zone, a \"Profiles\" "
"menu (save, load as a draft, delete), saving to I<zones.conf>, a button to "
"register the hotkeys and a button to check \"put the active window into the "
"zone\".  The minimum zone size is 5 % of the screen; a zone of zero area is "
"not saved.  B<--monitor> I<N> selects the monitor, B<--shot> I<FILE.png> "
"saves a snapshot of the interface and exits (for checks)."
msgstr ""
"按原始比例显示显示器工作区的 GTK 3 窗口。区域可以用鼠标拖动，也可以拉边或拉"
"角；吸附到屏幕边缘、相邻区域，以及 1/4、1/3、1/2、2/3、3/4 线。在空白处双击创"
"建区域，I<Delete> 删除；提供布局模板（2 列、1 + 2、2 × 2、3 列、主区域 + 堆"
"叠、空白），每个区域有名称和快捷键，「方案」菜单（保存、以草稿载入、删除），"
"保存到 I<zones.conf>，注册快捷键的按钮，以及「把活动窗口放入区域」的检查按"
"钮。区域最小尺寸为屏幕的 5 %；面积为零的区域不保存。B<--monitor> I<N> 选择显"
"示器，B<--shot> I<文件.png> 保存界面截图并退出（用于检查）。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:346
#, no-wrap
msgid "gridsnap-picker — the zone picking overlay"
msgstr "gridsnap-picker —— 区域选择器"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:355
msgid ""
"Shows the zones of the active monitor on top of the work area. The zone "
"under the cursor and the current selection are highlighted; the arrows move "
"the selection by the geometry of the zones, I<Enter> puts the active window "
"into the selected zone (and records the operation in the history), I<Esc> "
"cancels; a left click places, a right click cancels. An excluded window "
"(B<[ignore]> or a utility type) is not moved: code 1 and a message. The "
"overlay grabs the keyboard itself, so the arrows do not go to another window."
msgstr ""
"在工作桌面上显示活动显示器的区域。光标下的区域和当前选择会高亮；方向键按区域"
"几何移动选择，I<Enter> 把活动窗口放入所选区域（并把操作写入历史），I<Esc> 取"
"消；左键放入，右键取消。被排除的窗口（B<[ignore]> 或特殊类型）不移动：返回码 "
"1 并给消息。区域选择器自己捕获键盘，因此方向键不会跑到别的窗口去。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:362
msgid ""
"B<--select> I<ZONE> sets the initial selection, B<--monitor> I<N> — the "
"monitor (the active window's monitor by default, otherwise the one under the "
"cursor), B<--window> I<XID> — the window to place, B<--dry-run> only prints "
"the target frame, B<--verify> checks the frame after placing, B<--quiet> "
"does not print the line about the placement, B<--shot> I<FILE.png> draws the "
"overlay to PNG and exits without interaction."
msgstr ""
"B<--select> I<区域> 指定初始选择，B<--monitor> I<N> 指定显示器（默认是活动窗"
"口的显示器，否则是光标下的），B<--window> I<XID> 指定要放入的窗口，B<--dry-"
"run> 只打印目标边框，B<--verify> 在放入后核对边框，B<--quiet> 不打印放入的那"
"行，B<--shot> I<文件.png> 把区域选择器画成 PNG 并无交互地退出。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:362
#, no-wrap
msgid "gridsnap-hotcorners — zone highlighting while dragging a window"
msgstr "gridsnap-hotcorners —— 拖拽窗口时高亮区域"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:367
msgid ""
"Dragging a window by its title bar highlights the zone under the cursor, and "
"releasing drops the window into it. It is a separate process: not needed for "
"ordinary work, it does not get in the daemon's way, and the user sets up a "
"hotkey for it themselves (as for B<gridsnap-picker>)."
msgstr ""
"用标题栏拖动窗口时，光标下的区域会高亮，松开后窗口落入该区域。这是一个独立进"
"程：日常使用不需要它，也不妨碍守护进程；快捷键由用户自己设置（和 B<gridsnap-"
"picker> 一样）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:376
msgid ""
"X11 does not report “a window is being dragged”, so the watcher listens to "
"XInput2 raw events on the root window (they arrive even when the device is "
"grabbed by the window manager) and counts a press in the title bar of the "
"active window as a drag. While the grid is shown, Cinnamon's “throw to the "
"edge” (I<edge-tiling>) is muted so that the window does not jump twice, and "
"it is restored right after the release — the setting is not left off. If "
"XInput2 is unavailable, the watcher polls the pointer about 30 times per "
"second. Details are in I<docs/specs/zone-hotcorners.md>."
msgstr ""
"X11 不会报告「窗口正在被拖动」，因此 watcher 监听 root 上的 XInput2 原始事件"
"（即使设备被窗口管理器抓取也会到达），并把在活动窗口标题栏上的按下算作拖动。"
"显示网格期间，Cinnamon 的「甩到边缘」（I<edge-tiling>）会被临时关闭，以免窗口"
"被放两次；松开后立即恢复——设置不会被留在关闭状态。如果 XInput2 起不来，"
"watcher 就以约每秒 30 次的频率轮询指针。细节见 I<docs/specs/zone-"
"hotcorners.md>。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:381
msgid ""
"B<--no-hud> turns the highlighting off (the window is still dropped on "
"release, I<edge-tiling> is not touched), B<--dry-run> prints what the "
"watcher would do without moving anything, B<--verbose> writes every event "
"(press, HUD shown, I<edge-tiling>, drop) to stderr."
msgstr ""
"B<--no-hud> 关闭高亮（松开时窗口照样落入区域，I<edge-tiling> 不动）、B<--dry-"
"run> 只打印 watcher 会做什么、不动任何东西，B<--verbose> 把每个事件（按下、显"
"示 HUD、I<edge-tiling>、落入）写到 stderr。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:381
#, no-wrap
msgid "gridsnap-ctl — the daemon's IPC client"
msgstr "gridsnap-ctl —— 守护进程的 IPC 客户端"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:384
msgid ""
"Talks to the UNIX socket of B<gridsnap-daemon>: one JSON command per "
"connection, the reply is also a JSON line. Commands:"
msgstr ""
"与 B<gridsnap-daemon> 的 UNIX 套接字通话：每个连接一条 JSON 命令，应答同样是"
"一行 JSON。命令："

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:384
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<status>"
msgstr "B<status>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:390
msgid ""
"The daemon's state: I<conf>, I<version>, I<reflow>, I<profile> (I<null> for "
"now), I<monitors> (work areas), I<zones> (fractions 0..1), I<zones_px> "
"(pixel frames for every monitor), I<windows> (window, zone, monitor) and "
"I<filled> (expanded reflow neighbours)."
msgstr ""
"守护进程状态：I<conf>、I<version>、I<reflow>、I<profile>（目前为 I<null>）、"
"I<monitors>（工作区）、I<zones>（0..1 的比例）、I<zones_px>（每个显示器的像素"
"边框）、I<windows>（窗口、区域、显示器）和 I<filled>（reflow 扩展出的邻居）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:395
msgid ""
"Put a window into a zone: B<--window> I<XID> (the active window by default), "
"B<--monitor> I<N>. A success is recorded in the daemon's tracker, so closing "
"the window then starts reflow as usual."
msgstr ""
"把窗口放入区域：B<--window> I<XID>（默认是活动窗口）、B<--monitor> I<N>。成功"
"会写入守护进程的跟踪记录，因此之后关闭窗口会正常触发 reflow。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:402
msgid ""
"\"Only this zone\" mode: minimize all windows of the same workspace and "
"monitor except the target (B<--window> I<XID>, the active one by default)  "
"and put it into I<ZONE>; without a zone the window is not moved. A repeated "
"command and B<--off> leave the mode. B<focus> has no B<--monitor>: the area "
"is taken from the target window."
msgstr ""
"「只留这个区域」模式：最小化同一桌面和显示器上除目标（B<--window> I<XID>，默"
"认是活动窗口）之外的所有窗口，并把它放入 I<区域>；不给区域时窗口不移动。重复"
"命令和 B<--off> 都是退出。B<focus> 没有 B<--monitor>：范围取自目标窗口。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:402
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<reload>"
msgstr "B<reload>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:405
msgid ""
"Re-read I<zones.conf> (grid, rules, reflow); the monitor cache is dropped."
msgstr "重新读取 I<zones.conf>（网格、规则、reflow）；显示器缓存被清空。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:405
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<quit>"
msgstr "B<quit>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:408
msgid "Ask the daemon to terminate after the current event."
msgstr "请求守护进程在当前事件之后退出。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:408
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<watch>"
msgstr "B<watch>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:422
msgid ""
"Subscribe to the daemon's events and print them: one JSON line per event on "
"stdout until the connection is closed (B<Ctrl-C> — exit code 0). The "
"subscription covers all groups (I<window>, I<focus>); there is no option to "
"choose groups. One line about the subscription goes to stderr (B<--quiet> "
"suppresses it). No daemon or a rejected command — exit code 1; a zone, "
"window or monitor in the arguments — exit code 2. Events and their fields: "
"I<window-appeared> (I<window>, I<zone>, I<workspace>, I<monitor>), I<window-"
"closed> (I<window>, I<zone>), I<window-moved> (I<window>, I<zone>, "
"I<previous>, I<workspace>, I<monitor>), I<focus-on> (I<zone>, I<window>, "
"I<minimized>), I<focus-off> (I<zone>, I<restored>, I<total>). I<window> is a "
"hex string, I<zone> is a name or I<null>, I<workspace> is the EWMH workspace "
"number, I<monitor> is I<[x, y, w, h]>."
msgstr ""
"订阅守护进程的事件并打印它们：stdout 上每个事件一行 JSON，直到连接关闭"
"（B<Ctrl-C> 退出码 0）。订阅覆盖所有组（I<window>、I<focus>），没有选择组的选"
"项；stderr 上打印一行订阅提示（B<--quiet> 会去掉它）。没有守护进程或命令被拒"
"绝——退出码 1；参数里带区域、窗口或显示器——退出码 2。事件及字段：I<window-"
"appeared>（I<window>、I<zone>、I<workspace>、I<monitor>）、I<window-closed>"
"（I<window>、I<zone>）、I<window-moved>（I<window>、I<zone>、I<previous>、"
"I<workspace>、I<monitor>）、I<focus-on>（I<zone>、I<window>、I<minimized>）、"
"I<focus-off>（I<zone>、I<restored>、I<total>）。I<window> 是十六进制字符串，"
"I<zone> 是名称或 I<null>，I<workspace> 是 EWMH 桌面编号，I<monitor> 是 I<[x, "
"y, w, h]>。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:425
msgid ""
"B<--socket> I<PATH> sets the socket path, B<--raw> prints the reply on one "
"line, B<--quiet> prints nothing on success."
msgstr ""
"B<--socket> I<路径> 指定套接字路径，B<--raw> 把应答打成一行，B<--quiet> 在成"
"功时不打印任何东西。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:425
#, no-wrap
msgid "setup-hotkeys — Cinnamon hotkeys"
msgstr "setup-hotkeys —— Cinnamon 快捷键"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:442
msgid ""
"Reads B<[keys]> through B<gridsnap-tiler keys> (and B<[move]> — through "
"B<keys --move>) and creates Cinnamon custom hotkeys (the "
"I<org.cinnamon.desktop.keybindings> schemas) named \"zone-tiler: "
"E<lt>zoneE<gt>\" with the command B<python3 E<lt>code directoryE<gt>/zone-"
"tiler.py apply E<lt>zoneE<gt> --quiet> (with B<--conf> if it is given). The "
"optional B<[focus]> section gives one more hotkey, \"zone-tiler: focus\", "
"for \"only this zone\" mode; it is read from I<zones.conf> by the script "
"itself (through B<zone_config.load_focus_keys>). The optional B<[tabs]> "
"section gives a \"zone-tiler: tabs-next\" hotkey for \"the next window of "
"the zone\" (B<zone_config.load_tabs_config>).  Every "
"B<[action:E<lt>nameE<gt>]> section with a non-empty B<key> gives a \"zone-"
"tiler: action E<lt>nameE<gt>\" hotkey with the command B<gridsnap-tiler "
"action E<lt>nameE<gt> --quiet> (the script installs it itself, like the zone "
"keys). All hotkeys installed by earlier runs (by name prefix) are removed "
"first, so that no garbage is left.  B<--list> only shows the plan, B<--"
"remove> deletes the GridSnap hotkeys and installs nothing, B<--conf> I<PATH> "
"points at the config."
msgstr ""
"通过 B<gridsnap-tiler keys> 读取 B<[keys]>（B<[move]> 则通过 B<keys --"
"move>），并创建用户快捷键（方案 I<org.cinnamon.desktop.keybindings>），名为"
"「zone-tiler: E<lt>区域E<gt>」，命令为 B<python3 E<lt>代码目录E<gt>/zone-"
"tiler.py apply E<lt>区域E<gt> --quiet>（若指定了 B<--conf> 则带上它）。可选"
"的 B<[focus]> 段给出一个「zone-tiler: focus」快捷键，用于「只留这个区域」模"
"式；它由脚本自己从 I<zones.conf> 读取（通过 "
"B<zone_config.load_focus_keys>）。可选的 B<[tabs]> 段给出「zone-tiler: tabs-"
"next」快捷键，用于「区域的下一个窗口」（B<zone_config.load_tabs_config>）。每"
"个 B<key> 非空的 B<[action:E<lt>名称E<gt>]> 段给出「zone-tiler: action E<lt>"
"名称E<gt>」快捷键，命令为 B<gridsnap-tiler action E<lt>名称E<gt> --quiet>（同"
"样由脚本自己安装，和区域快捷键一样）。以前几次运行安装的所有快捷键（按名称前"
"缀识别）会先被移除，以免留下垃圾。B<--list> 只显示计划，B<--remove> 删除 "
"GridSnap 的快捷键且不安装任何东西，B<--conf> I<路径> 指定配置。"

#. type: SH
#: man/gridsnap.1:442
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr "选项"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:445
msgid ""
"Keys of B<gridsnap-tiler> (common to all its commands unless stated "
"otherwise):"
msgstr "B<gridsnap-tiler> 的选项（除非另有说明，对其所有子命令通用）："

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:445
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-h, --help>"
msgstr "B<-h, --help>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:448
msgid "Help on the arguments and exit."
msgstr "打印参数帮助并退出。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:448
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--conf>I< PATH>"
msgstr "B<--conf>I< 路径>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:453
msgid ""
"The configuration file. By default I<$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/gridsnap/zones.conf>, "
"and if it does not exist — I<zones.conf> next to the code. The flag carries "
"the profiles directory along with it."
msgstr ""
"配置文件。默认是 I<$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/gridsnap/zones.conf>，没有它时是代码旁边"
"的 I<zones.conf>。该标志也会带走方案目录。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:453
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--monitor>I< N>"
msgstr "B<--monitor>I< N>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:458
msgid ""
"The monitor number (0 by default). Used by the B<list>, B<apply>, B<stack> "
"and B<action> commands (for an action — the screen on which the zone is "
"looked up)."
msgstr ""
"显示器编号（默认 0）。供 B<list>、B<apply>、B<stack> 和 B<action> 使用（对动"
"作而言是查找区域的屏幕）。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:458
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--window>I< XID>"
msgstr "B<--window>I< XID>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:462
msgid ""
"The window identifier for B<apply>, B<focus> and B<action>: decimal or I<0x…"
">. The active window by default."
msgstr ""
"给 B<apply>、B<focus> 和 B<action> 用的窗口标识：十进制或 I<0x…>。默认是活动"
"窗口。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:462
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--off>"
msgstr "B<--off>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:466
msgid ""
"B<focus>: explicitly leave \"only this zone\" mode (restore what the mode "
"minimized) instead of entering it."
msgstr ""
"B<focus>：显式退出「只留这个区域」模式（展开被模式最小化的窗口），而不是进入"
"模式。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:466
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--by>I< auto|rules|order>"
msgstr "B<--by>I< auto|rules|order>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:469
msgid "How windows are chosen for B<arrange> (I<auto> by default), see above."
msgstr "B<arrange> 选窗口的方式（默认 I<auto>），见上文。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:469
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--all>"
msgstr "B<--all>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:472
msgid "B<undo>: roll back the whole history instead of the last operation."
msgstr "B<undo>：回滚整个历史，而不是最后一次操作。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:472
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--no-hotkeys>"
msgstr "B<--no-hotkeys>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:475
msgid "B<profile use>: do not register hotkeys after activating the profile."
msgstr "B<profile use>：启用方案后不注册快捷键。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:475
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--json>"
msgstr "B<--json>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:478
msgid ""
"B<profile export>: print JSON to stdout instead of writing a file. B<profile "
"gallery>: the same JSON instead of a table."
msgstr ""
"B<profile export>：把 JSON 打印到 stdout，而不是写文件。B<profile gallery>："
"同样的 JSON，而不是表格。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:478
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--name>I< NAME>"
msgstr "B<--name>I< 名称>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:483
msgid ""
"B<profile import>: the profile name; taken from the JSON by default. "
"B<profile from-gallery>: the name of the profile to copy the layout into; by "
"default the layout id."
msgstr ""
"B<profile import>：方案名称；默认取自 JSON。B<profile from-gallery>：复制布局"
"所用的方案名称；默认是布局的 id。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:483
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--dry-run>"
msgstr "B<--dry-run>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:486
msgid "Only compute the frame: do not move the window, write no history."
msgstr "只计算边框：不移动窗口，不写入历史。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:486
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--verify>"
msgstr "B<--verify>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:490
msgid ""
"Re-read the real window geometry after the layout and compare it with the "
"zone."
msgstr "布局后重新读取窗口的实际几何并与区域比较。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:490
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--quiet>"
msgstr "B<--quiet>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:493
msgid ""
"Do not print success messages (in B<--help> the description is not shown)."
msgstr "不打印成功消息（在 B<--help> 里不输出该说明）。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:493
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--version>"
msgstr "B<--version>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:496
msgid "Prints I<zone-tiler 0.2.0> and exits."
msgstr "打印 I<zone-tiler 0.2.0> 并退出。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:499
msgid ""
"The keys of the other commands are listed in the COMMANDS section; each of "
"them also has B<-h> and B<--version>."
msgstr "其余命令的选项列在「命令」一节；每个命令也都有 B<-h> 和 B<--version>。"

#. type: SH
#: man/gridsnap.1:499
#, no-wrap
msgid "CONFIGURATION"
msgstr "配置"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:507
msgid ""
"The configuration is a single UTF-8 INI file, I<zones.conf>. By default "
"I<$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/gridsnap/zones.conf> is taken (usually I<~/.config/"
"gridsnap/zones.conf>); if it does not exist — the file I<zones.conf> next to "
"the code (I</usr/lib/gridsnap/zones.conf> for a system package). B<--conf> "
"I<PATH> overrides the choice. Comments are I<#> and I<;> (including at the "
"end of a line after a space); the separator is only I<=>, so the key "
"I<re:E<lt>regexE<gt>> is not split at the colon."
msgstr ""
"配置是一个 UTF-8 的 INI 文件 I<zones.conf>。默认取 I<$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/"
"gridsnap/zones.conf>（通常是 I<~/.config/gridsnap/zones.conf>）；没有它时取代"
"码旁边的 I<zones.conf> 文件（系统软件包中为 I</usr/lib/gridsnap/"
"zones.conf>）。B<--conf> I<路径> 取消该选择。注释用 I<#> 和 I<;>（包括行末空"
"格之后的）；分隔符只有 I<=>，因此键 I<re:E<lt>regexE<gt>> 不会在冒号处被切"
"开。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:507
#, no-wrap
msgid "[grid]"
msgstr "[grid]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:511
msgid ""
"Grid lines: B<cols> and B<rows> — increasing lists of fractions separated by "
"a comma, a space or a semicolon; the last line must be I<1.0>. Needed only "
"by range zones."
msgstr ""
"网格线：B<cols> 和 B<rows> 是用逗号、空格或分号分隔的递增比例列表；最后一条线"
"必须是 I<1.0>。只有范围形式的区域需要它们。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:511
#, no-wrap
msgid "[zones]"
msgstr "[zones]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:514
msgid ""
"Zone name = one of two forms (zone names are lowercased — that is how "
"ConfigParser works):"
msgstr ""
"区域名 = 两种形式之一（区域名会被转成小写——ConfigParser 就是这么工作的）："

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:515
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<x, y, w, h>"
msgstr "B<x, y, w, h>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:518
msgid ""
"A free rectangle as fractions of the work area: I<0 E<lt>= x E<lt> 1>, I<0 "
"E<lt>= y E<lt> 1>, I<w E<gt> 0>, I<h E<gt> 0>, I<x+w E<lt>= 1>, I<y+h E<lt>= "
"1>. This is the canonical form; the editor saves the file in it."
msgstr ""
"按工作区比例给出的自由矩形：I<0 E<lt>= x E<lt> 1>、I<0 E<lt>= y E<lt> 1>、"
"I<w E<gt> 0>、I<h E<gt> 0>、I<x+w E<lt>= 1>、I<y+h E<lt>= 1>。这是标准形式，"
"编辑器就以它保存文件。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:518
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<c0:c1, r0:r1>"
msgstr "B<c0:c1, r0:r1>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:521
msgid ""
"A range of grid cells: indices of the B<cols> and B<rows> lines (I<0 E<lt>= "
"c0 E<lt> c1 E<lt>= number of columns>). Read for compatibility."
msgstr ""
"网格单元范围：B<cols> 和 B<rows> 线的索引（I<0 E<lt>= c0 E<lt> c1 E<lt>= 列数"
">）。读取它只为兼容。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:524
msgid "At least one zone is required."
msgstr "至少要有一个区域。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:524
#, no-wrap
msgid "[rules]"
msgstr "[rules]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:532
msgid ""
"The section is optional. Auto-tiling rules: I<selector = zone name>. A "
"selector is a case-insensitive glob on I<WM_CLASS> or I<re:E<lt>regexE<gt>> "
"— a regular expression (I<re.search>, case-insensitive) on the I<class|"
"title> string. Line order matters: the first match wins. A rule pointing at "
"a zone that is not in B<[zones]> is a config error; an invalid regular "
"expression simply never matches. Key case is preserved in this section."
msgstr ""
"该段可选。自动放置规则：I<选择器 = 区域名>。选择器是对 I<WM_CLASS> 的不区分大"
"小写 glob，或者 I<re:E<lt>regexE<gt>>——对 I<类|标题> 字符串的（I<re.search>，"
"不区分大小写）正则。行的顺序有意义：第一个匹配者胜出。规则指向 B<[zones]> 中"
"不存在的区域是配置错误；不正确的正则只是永远不匹配。这一段里键的大小写会被保"
"留。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:532
#, no-wrap
msgid "[ignore]"
msgstr "[ignore]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:540
msgid ""
"The section is optional. Exclusion windows: I<selector = note>. The "
"selectors are the same as in B<[rules]> (a glob on I<WM_CLASS> or "
"I<re:E<lt>regexE<gt>> on the I<class|title> string); the right-hand side is "
"a note for a human and for the daemon's log. An excluded window is moved "
"neither by the daemon, nor by B<arrange>/B<stack>, nor by B<apply>/B<move>/"
"B<undo>, nor by the picker, nor by the B<zone-hotcorners> drag watcher; it "
"can be moved only by removing the rule."
msgstr ""
"该段可选。排除窗口：I<选择器 = 备注>。选择器与 B<[rules]> 相同（对 "
"I<WM_CLASS> 的 glob，或对 I<类|标题> 字符串的 I<re:E<lt>regexE<gt>>）；右边是"
"给人看和写进守护进程日志的备注。被排除的窗口，守护进程不移动，B<arrange>/"
"B<stack>、B<apply>/B<move>/B<undo>、区域选择器以及 B<zone-hotcorners> 的拖拽"
"监视也都不动它；想挪动它只能删掉这条规则。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:540
#, no-wrap
msgid "[keys]"
msgstr "[keys]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:543
msgid ""
"Hotkeys: I<zone name = Cinnamon hotkey>, for example "
"I<E<lt>SuperE<gt>E<lt>AltE<gt>1>."
msgstr ""
"按键绑定：I<区域名 = Cinnamon 快捷键>，例如 "
"I<E<lt>SuperE<gt>E<lt>AltE<gt>1>。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:543
#, no-wrap
msgid "[move]"
msgstr "[move]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:548
msgid ""
"The section is optional. Moving a window into a neighbouring zone: "
"I<direction = Cinnamon hotkey>, the directions are I<left>, I<right>, I<up>, "
"I<down> (the B<move> command). Without the section the defaults apply; a key "
"that is not one of the directions is a config error (code 3)."
msgstr ""
"该段可选。把窗口移到相邻区域：I<方向 = Cinnamon 快捷键>，方向为 I<left>、"
"I<right>、I<up>、I<down>（命令 B<move>）。没有该段时使用默认值；键不属于方向"
"是配置错误（返回码 3）。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:548
#, no-wrap
msgid "[focus]"
msgstr "[focus]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:556
msgid ""
"The section is optional. B<key> — the hotkey of \"only this zone\" mode in "
"Cinnamon syntax; B<zone> — the zone the window is put into (optional). "
"Without B<zone> the hotkey only minimizes windows without moving the target. "
"An unknown key in the section and an empty B<zone> value are a config error "
"(code 3). The section is carried over by B<setup-hotkeys> (the name \"zone-"
"tiler: focus\") and by the editor; it is not part of layout profiles."
msgstr ""
"该段可选。B<key>——「只留这个区域」模式在 Cinnamon 语法下的快捷键；B<zone>——窗"
"口放入的区域（可选）。没有 B<zone> 时快捷键只最小化窗口，不移动目标。段中未知"
"的键和空的 B<zone> 值都是配置错误（返回码 3）。这一段由 B<setup-hotkeys>（名"
"称「zone-tiler: focus」）和编辑器搬运；它不进入布局方案。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:556
#, no-wrap
msgid "[tabs]"
msgstr "[tabs]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:567
msgid ""
"The section is optional. B<key> — the hotkey for \"the next window of the "
"zone\" (the B<tabs-next> command) in Cinnamon syntax; B<height> — the tab "
"strip height in pixels, an integer greater than zero (22 by default). "
"Without B<key> no hotkey is registered; B<height> is read without it as "
"well.  An unknown key in the section and garbage in B<height> (not a number, "
"zero, negative) are a config error (code 3): a strip of zero height is "
"invisible, and the tabs would silently become invisible.  The section is "
"carried over by B<setup-hotkeys> (the name \"zone-tiler: tabs-next\") and by "
"the editor — verbatim, as a foreign section; it is not part of layout "
"profiles."
msgstr ""
"该段可选。B<key>——「区域的下一个窗口」（命令 B<tabs-next>）在 Cinnamon 语法下"
"的快捷键；B<height>——标签栏高度（像素），大于零的整数（默认 22）。没有 "
"B<key> 时不注册快捷键，B<height> 不依赖它也会被读取。段中未知的键和 "
"B<height> 里的垃圾（不是数字、零、负数）是配置错误（返回码 3）：高度为零的标"
"签栏看不见，标签页就会悄悄变得不可见。这一段由 B<setup-hotkeys>（名称「zone-"
"tiler: tabs-next」）和编辑器搬运——按原样搬，当作别人的段；它不进入布局方案。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:567
#, no-wrap
msgid "[action:E<lt>nameE<gt>]"
msgstr "[action:E<lt>名称E<gt>]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:570
msgid ""
"The section is optional: one section is one instance of an action, the name "
"from I<[a-z0-9_-]> (the B<action E<lt>nameE<gt>> command). Fields:"
msgstr ""
"该段可选：一个段就是一个动作实例，名称取自 I<[a-z0-9_-]>（命令 B<action E<lt>"
"名称E<gt>>）。字段："

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:571
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<run>"
msgstr "B<run>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:576
msgid ""
"Required: I<builtin:E<lt>nameE<gt>> (I<minimize-others>, I<show-window>, "
"I<mirror>, I<terminal>) or a custom command — it is parsed by B<shlex>, "
"without a shell and without waiting."
msgstr ""
"必填：I<builtin:E<lt>名称E<gt>>（I<minimize-others>、I<show-window>、"
"I<mirror>、I<terminal>）或者自定义命令——它由 B<shlex> 解析，不经过 shell，也"
"不等待。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:576
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<zone>"
msgstr "B<zone>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:581
msgid ""
"The subject zone: the window is looked for in it (the active one if it is "
"there, otherwise the topmost by I<_NET_CLIENT_LIST>). Without the field the "
"subject is the active window and the zone it stands in."
msgstr ""
"对象区域：在其中查找窗口（若它在那里则是活动窗口，否则取 I<_NET_CLIENT_LIST> "
"中最上面的）。没有该字段时，对象是活动窗口和它所在的区域。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:581
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<key>"
msgstr "B<key>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:585
msgid ""
"The Cinnamon hotkey for B<setup-hotkeys>; the hotkey name is \"zone-tiler: "
"action E<lt>nameE<gt>\"."
msgstr ""
"给 B<setup-hotkeys> 用的 Cinnamon 快捷键；快捷键名为「zone-tiler: action "
"E<lt>名称E<gt>」。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:585
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<command>"
msgstr "B<command>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:589
msgid ""
"Only for I<builtin:terminal>: what to start the terminal with (I<x-terminal-"
"emulator> by default)."
msgstr ""
"仅对 I<builtin:terminal>：用什么启动终端（默认 I<x-terminal-emulator>）。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:589
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<axis>"
msgstr "B<axis>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:593
msgid ""
"Only for I<builtin:mirror>: the mirror axis, I<horizontal> (the default) or "
"I<vertical>."
msgstr "仅对 I<builtin:mirror>：镜像轴为 I<horizontal>（默认）或 I<vertical>。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:600
msgid ""
"An empty field, an unknown field of the section, B<command> or B<axis> not "
"with its own action, an axis that is not in the list, a section name that is "
"not from I<[a-z0-9_-]> — a config error (code 3): a typo would leave a "
"person without an action or without a key. The editor does not edit the "
"section and carries it over verbatim, like B<[focus]>/B<[tabs]>."
msgstr ""
"空字段、段中未知的字段、不属于相应动作的 B<command> 或 B<axis>、不在列表里的"
"轴、不在 I<[a-z0-9_-]> 里的段名，都是配置错误（返回码 3）：一个笔误会让人失去"
"动作或失去按键。编辑器不修改这一段，像 B<[focus]>/B<[tabs]> 一样按原样搬运。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:600
#, no-wrap
msgid "[workspaces]"
msgstr "[workspaces]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:605
msgid ""
"The section is optional. A grid of its own per Cinnamon workspace: "
"I<workspace number = profile name> (EWMH numbering, from zero). The daemon "
"takes the grid by the window's workspace and does reflow only on the visible "
"workspace.  Edited in the editor (\"Workspace profiles…\")."
msgstr ""
"该段可选。给 Cinnamon 工作桌面的自有网格：I<桌面编号 = 方案名>（EWMH 编号，从"
"零开始）。守护进程按窗口所在桌面取网格，并且只在可见桌面上做 reflow。在编辑器"
"中编辑（「桌面方案…」）。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:605
#, no-wrap
msgid "[monitors]"
msgstr "[monitors]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:612
msgid ""
"The section is optional. A grid of its own per screen: I<output name = "
"profile name> (I<HDMI-1>, I<eDP-1>). The screen beats the workspace: "
"B<apply>/B<move>/B<arrange>/B<stack> look the zone up first in the screen "
"profile (B<[monitors]>), then the workspace one (B<[workspaces]>), then in "
"I<zones.conf>. The snapshot of the bindings is assembled into the active "
"config by B<profile use-monitors>, which is what autostart calls at session "
"start."
msgstr ""
"该段可选。给屏幕的自有网格：I<输出名 = 方案名>（I<HDMI-1>、I<eDP-1>）。屏幕优"
"先于桌面：B<apply>/B<move>/B<arrange>/B<stack> 先找屏幕方案（B<[monitors]>）"
"中的区域，然后找桌面（B<[workspaces]>），最后找 I<zones.conf>。把绑定快照组装"
"进活动配置的是 B<profile use-monitors>，登录会话时自动启动调用的就是它。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:612
#, no-wrap
msgid "[daemon]"
msgstr "[daemon]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:616
msgid ""
"The section is optional. B<reflow = off | neighbors> (I<off> by default; "
"case and spaces do not matter, an unknown value is treated as I<off>). The "
"I<neighbors> mode is described in the COMMANDS section."
msgstr ""
"该段可选。B<reflow = off | neighbors>（默认 I<off>；大小写和空格无关紧要，未"
"知值按 I<off> 处理）。I<neighbors> 模式见「命令」一节。"

#. type: SS
#: man/gridsnap.1:616
#, no-wrap
msgid "theme.conf"
msgstr "theme.conf"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:624
msgid ""
"An optional second INI file next to I<zones.conf>: one palette for the "
"surfaces GridSnap draws itself — the picker overlay, the hot-corners HUD, "
"the tab strip and the editor. The section B<[theme]> holds the switches, "
"B<[colors]> the colours (a colour in B<[theme]> is accepted too). Without "
"the file every surface keeps its built-in colours. Unknown keys are ignored; "
"a malformed value keeps the base colour and prints one warning on stderr, so "
"a typo never hides the grid."
msgstr ""
"可选的第二个 INI 文件，位于 I<zones.conf> 旁边：为 GridSnap 自己绘制的界面提"
"供一套配色——选择器覆盖层、热角 HUD、标签栏和编辑器。B<[theme]> 段保存开关，"
"B<[colors]> 段保存颜色（B<[theme]> 中的颜色也接受）。没有该文件时，每个界面保"
"留内置颜色。未知键被忽略；格式错误的值保留基色并向 stderr 打印一条警告，因此"
"一个笔误永远不会让网格消失。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:632
msgid ""
"Colours are I<#RRGGBB>: I<bg> (behind everything), I<bg_panel> (the tab "
"strip, the editor canvas), I<bg_card> (a tab, a button, an entry), "
"I<bg_hover> (the active tab, a hovered button), I<fg>, I<fg_muted>, "
"I<accent> (the selection, the active tab stripe, a checked button), "
"I<border>, I<danger>, I<ok>, and I<zones> — up to 16 zone colours separated "
"by commas; without I<zones> eight hues are derived from I<accent>."
msgstr ""
"颜色为 I<#RRGGBB>：I<bg>（所有内容之后的背景）、I<bg_panel>（标签栏、编辑器画"
"布）、I<bg_card>（标签页、按钮、输入框）、I<bg_hover>（活动标签页、悬停按"
"钮）、I<fg>、I<fg_muted>、I<accent>（选中、活动标签页色条、按下按钮）、"
"I<border>、I<danger>、I<ok>，以及 I<zones>——最多 16 个区域颜色，以逗号分隔；"
"没有 I<zones> 时从 I<accent> 推导出八种色调。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:638
msgid ""
"In B<[theme]>: B<preset> is one of I<43pr>, I<nord>, I<tokyo-night>, "
"I<catppuccin-mocha>, I<graphite> (the B<[colors]> values override whatever "
"the preset names); B<radius> is the zone corner radius in px, 0..64, I<10> "
"by default; B<font> is the Pango family of the labels, I<Sans> by default."
msgstr ""
"在 B<[theme]> 中：B<preset> 是 I<43pr>、I<nord>、I<tokyo-night>、"
"I<catppuccin-mocha>、I<graphite> 之一（B<[colors]> 的值覆盖预设命名的值）；"
"B<radius> 是区域圆角半径（px，0..64，默认 I<10>）；B<font> 是标签的 Pango 字"
"族，默认 I<Sans>。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:644
msgid ""
"The editor's “From the wallpaper…” action writes this file from the desktop "
"picture and marks its first line as generated; the running daemon then "
"follows I<picture-uri> and rewrites the palette when the image changes. "
"Deleting the file — or removing that first line — returns the built-in "
"colours and stops the refresh."
msgstr ""
"编辑器的“从壁纸…”操作根据桌面图片写入该文件，并把第一行标记为已生成；随后运行"
"中的守护进程跟踪 I<picture-uri>，在图片变化时重写配色。删除该文件——或去掉第一"
"行——即恢复内置颜色并停止刷新。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:650
msgid ""
"The file does not theme window decorations: Muffin never reads a metacity "
"theme, so the borders of server-side decorated windows stay as it draws "
"them.  The editor can also write a GTK 3 controls theme with the same "
"palette; while its files carry the generated marker, the daemon keeps them "
"in step with the palette, and picking the theme in Cinnamon Settings is the "
"user's action."
msgstr ""
"该文件不美化窗口边框：Muffin 从不读取 metacity 主题，因此服务端装饰的窗口边框保持"
"它绘制的样子。编辑器还可以写入使用同一配色的 GTK 3 控件主题；当其文件带有生成标记时，"
"守护进程会使其与配色保持一致；在 Cinnamon 设置中选择该主题由用户完成。"

#. type: SH
#: man/gridsnap.1:650
#, no-wrap
msgid "EXAMPLES"
msgstr "示例"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:679
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"gridsnap-tiler list\n"
"gridsnap-tiler apply main --dry-run\n"
"gridsnap-tiler apply bottom --monitor 1 --verify\n"
"gridsnap-tiler arrange --by order\n"
"gridsnap-tiler stack main\n"
"gridsnap-tiler tabs-next\n"
"gridsnap-tiler undo --all\n"
"gridsnap-tiler focus main\n"
"gridsnap-tiler focus --off\n"
"gridsnap-tiler action mirror\n"
"gridsnap-tiler action term-main --dry-run\n"
"gridsnap-tiler profile save work\n"
"gridsnap-tiler profile use work --no-hotkeys\n"
"gridsnap-tiler profile gallery\n"
"gridsnap-tiler profile from-gallery work --name mine\n"
"gridsnap-tiler keys\n"
"gridsnap-daemon --verbose\n"
"gridsnap-daemon --once --conf ~/.config/gridsnap/zones.conf\n"
"gridsnap-ctl status\n"
"gridsnap-ctl apply main --monitor 1\n"
"gridsnap-ctl focus main\n"
"gridsnap-ctl focus --off\n"
"gridsnap-ctl watch\n"
"setup-hotkeys --list\n"
"gridsnap-picker --select top-right\n"
"gridsnap-hotcorners --dry-run --verbose\n"
"gridsnap-editor --conf ~/.config/gridsnap/zones.conf\n"
msgstr ""
"gridsnap-tiler list\n"
"gridsnap-tiler apply main --dry-run\n"
"gridsnap-tiler apply bottom --monitor 1 --verify\n"
"gridsnap-tiler arrange --by order\n"
"gridsnap-tiler stack main\n"
"gridsnap-tiler tabs-next\n"
"gridsnap-tiler undo --all\n"
"gridsnap-tiler focus main\n"
"gridsnap-tiler focus --off\n"
"gridsnap-tiler action mirror\n"
"gridsnap-tiler action term-main --dry-run\n"
"gridsnap-tiler profile save work\n"
"gridsnap-tiler profile use work --no-hotkeys\n"
"gridsnap-tiler profile gallery\n"
"gridsnap-tiler profile from-gallery work --name mine\n"
"gridsnap-tiler keys\n"
"gridsnap-daemon --verbose\n"
"gridsnap-daemon --once --conf ~/.config/gridsnap/zones.conf\n"
"gridsnap-ctl status\n"
"gridsnap-ctl apply main --monitor 1\n"
"gridsnap-ctl focus main\n"
"gridsnap-ctl focus --off\n"
"gridsnap-ctl watch\n"
"setup-hotkeys --list\n"
"gridsnap-picker --select top-right\n"
"gridsnap-hotcorners --dry-run --verbose\n"
"gridsnap-editor --conf ~/.config/gridsnap/zones.conf\n"

#. type: SH
#: man/gridsnap.1:680
#, no-wrap
msgid "HOTKEYS"
msgstr "快捷键"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:686
msgid ""
"Hotkeys are set in the B<[keys]> section of I<zones.conf> and registered in "
"Cinnamon by the B<setup-hotkeys> command (or by a button in the editor) as "
"custom hotkeys named \"zone-tiler: E<lt>zoneE<gt>\" that run B<gridsnap-"
"tiler apply E<lt>zoneE<gt> --quiet>. After editing B<[keys]> by hand you "
"have to re-run B<setup-hotkeys>, otherwise the new zone names will not be "
"tied to keys."
msgstr ""
"快捷键在 I<zones.conf> 的 B<[keys]> 段中给出，由 B<setup-hotkeys> 命令（或编"
"辑器里的按钮）注册为名为「zone-tiler: E<lt>区域E<gt>」的用户快捷键，执行 "
"B<gridsnap-tiler apply E<lt>区域E<gt> --quiet>。手工改过 B<[keys]> 之后要重新"
"运行 B<setup-hotkeys>，否则新的区域名不会与按键关联。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:692
msgid ""
"The shipped I<zones.conf> has four zones and four hotkeys: I<main> — "
"I<E<lt>SuperE<gt>E<lt>AltE<gt>1>, I<top-right> — "
"I<E<lt>SuperE<gt>E<lt>AltE<gt>2>, I<top-far> — "
"I<E<lt>SuperE<gt>E<lt>AltE<gt>3>, I<bottom> — "
"I<E<lt>SuperE<gt>E<lt>AltE<gt>4>."
msgstr ""
"随包提供的 I<zones.conf> 里有四个区域和四个快捷键：I<main>——"
"I<E<lt>SuperE<gt>E<lt>AltE<gt>1>，I<top-right>——"
"I<E<lt>SuperE<gt>E<lt>AltE<gt>2>，I<top-far>——"
"I<E<lt>SuperE<gt>E<lt>AltE<gt>3>，I<bottom>——"
"I<E<lt>SuperE<gt>E<lt>AltE<gt>4>。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:696
msgid ""
"The optional B<[focus]> section gives the key of \"only this zone\" mode "
"(B<gridsnap-tiler focus>): it is registered under the name \"zone-tiler: "
"focus\", so B<setup-hotkeys --remove> removes it together with the zone keys."
msgstr ""
"可选的 B<[focus]> 段给出「只留这个区域」模式的按键（B<gridsnap-tiler "
"focus>）：它以「zone-tiler: focus」为名注册，因此 B<setup-hotkeys --remove> "
"会把它和区域按键一起移除。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:701
msgid ""
"The optional B<[tabs]> section gives the \"next window of the zone\" key "
"(B<gridsnap-tiler tabs-next>) under the name \"zone-tiler: tabs-next\". The "
"key switches tabs in the zone of the active window; without a running daemon "
"there is nothing to switch."
msgstr ""
"可选的 B<[tabs]> 段给出「区域的下一个窗口」按键（B<gridsnap-tiler tabs-"
"next>），名为「zone-tiler: tabs-next」。该按键在活动窗口所在区域里切换标签"
"页；守护进程没运行时没有可切换的东西。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:707
msgid ""
"B<[action:E<lt>nameE<gt>]> sections with a non-empty B<key> give action keys "
"under the name \"zone-tiler: action E<lt>nameE<gt>\": the command is "
"B<gridsnap-tiler action E<lt>nameE<gt> --quiet>, that is, the same path as "
"the zone keys. B<setup-hotkeys --remove> removes them together with the rest."
msgstr ""
"B<key> 非空的 B<[action:E<lt>名称E<gt>]> 段给出名为「zone-tiler: action E<lt>"
"名称E<gt>」的动作按键：命令是 B<gridsnap-tiler action E<lt>名称E<gt> --"
"quiet>，也就是与区域按键相同的路径。B<setup-hotkeys --remove> 会把它们和其他"
"按键一起移除。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:713
msgid ""
"Switching a profile with one key is an ordinary Cinnamon custom hotkey that "
"calls B<gridsnap-tiler profile use E<lt>nameE<gt>>: the project does not "
"create keys of its own for profiles.  A hotkey for B<gridsnap-picker> (for "
"example I<Super+Z>) is set up by the user himself — B<setup-hotkeys> "
"installs only the zone keys from B<[keys]>."
msgstr ""
"用一个按键切换方案是普通的 Cinnamon 用户快捷键，调用 B<gridsnap-tiler "
"profile use E<lt>名称E<gt>>：项目没有为方案单独设置按键。B<gridsnap-picker> "
"的快捷键（例如 I<Super+Z>）由用户自己设置——B<setup-hotkeys> 只安装 B<[keys]> "
"里的区域按键。"

#. type: SH
#: man/gridsnap.1:713
#, no-wrap
msgid "FILES"
msgstr "文件"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:714
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<~/.config/gridsnap/zones.conf>"
msgstr "I<~/.config/gridsnap/zones.conf>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:719
msgid ""
"The active config (honouring I<$XDG_CONFIG_HOME>). If the file does not "
"exist, I<zones.conf> next to the code (I</usr/lib/gridsnap/zones.conf>) is "
"read and written."
msgstr ""
"活动配置（考虑 I<$XDG_CONFIG_HOME>）。没有该文件时，读写代码旁边的 "
"I<zones.conf>（I</usr/lib/gridsnap/zones.conf>）。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:719
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<~/.config/gridsnap/theme.conf>"
msgstr "I<~/.config/gridsnap/theme.conf>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:725
msgid ""
"The optional palette of the GridSnap surfaces, in the directory of the "
"active I<zones.conf>. The editor writes it from the wallpaper and the daemon "
"keeps it in step while its first line says it was generated; deleting it "
"returns the built-in colours."
msgstr ""
"GridSnap 界面的可选配色，位于活动 I<zones.conf> 所在目录。编辑器根据壁纸写入"
"它，守护进程在首行声明其已生成时保持其更新；删除后恢复内置颜色。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:725
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<~/.themes/Gridsnap>"
msgstr "I<~/.themes/Gridsnap>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:731
msgid ""
"The GTK 3 controls theme the editor writes (B<Window controls…> in the "
"B<Theme> menu). The daemon refreshes it from the current palette while its "
"files carry the generated marker; it must be selected in Cinnamon Settings, "
"Themes, Controls."
msgstr ""
"编辑器写入的 GTK 3 控件主题（“主题”菜单中的“窗口控件…”）。当其文件带有生成标记时，"
"守护进程按当前配色刷新它；需要在 Cinnamon 设置 → 主题 → 控件中选择。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:731
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<~/.local/state/gridsnap/history.json>"
msgstr "I<~/.local/state/gridsnap/history.json>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:735
msgid ""
"The layout history (honouring I<$XDG_STATE_HOME>): JSON, the last 20 "
"operations, written atomically. Needed by B<undo> in a separate process."
msgstr ""
"布局历史（考虑 I<$XDG_STATE_HOME>）：JSON，最近 20 次操作，写入是原子的。供另"
"一个进程中的 B<undo> 使用。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:735
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/gridsnap/daemon.sock>"
msgstr "I<$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/gridsnap/daemon.sock>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:739
msgid ""
"The daemon's UNIX socket (mode 0600, directory 0700). Without "
"I<$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR> — I</tmp/gridsnap-E<lt>uidE<gt>/daemon.sock>."
msgstr ""
"守护进程的 UNIX 套接字（权限 0600，目录 0700）。没有 I<$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR> 时"
"为 I</tmp/gridsnap-E<lt>uidE<gt>/daemon.sock>。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:739
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<~/.config/gridsnap/templates/*.conf>"
msgstr "I<~/.config/gridsnap/templates/*.conf>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:743
msgid ""
"Layout profiles (honouring I<$XDG_CONFIG_HOME>; with B<--conf> I<PATH> — the "
"I<templates> directory next to that file)."
msgstr ""
"布局方案（考虑 I<$XDG_CONFIG_HOME>；带 B<--conf> I<路径> 时是与该文件同级的 "
"I<templates> 目录）。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:743
#, no-wrap
msgid "I</usr/share/gridsnap/gallery/*.conf>"
msgstr "I</usr/share/gridsnap/gallery/*.conf>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:748
msgid ""
"Ready-made layouts shipped with the package (in a checkout — I<gallery/> "
"next to the code). The I<$GRIDSNAP_GALLERY> variable sets a custom "
"directory. A copy of a layout into a profile is made by B<profile from-"
"gallery>; the directory itself is never modified."
msgstr ""
"安装包自带的现成布局（在代码检出处——代码旁的 I<gallery/>）。自定义目录由 "
"I<$GRIDSNAP_GALLERY> 变量指定。把布局复制到方案由 B<profile from-gallery> 完"
"成；目录本身不会被修改。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:748
#, no-wrap
msgid "I</usr/lib/gridsnap>"
msgstr "I</usr/lib/gridsnap>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:753
msgid ""
"The package code: I<zone-tiler.py>, I<zone-daemon.py>, I<zone-editor.py>, "
"I<zone-picker.py>, I<zone-tabstrip.py>, I<gridsnap-ctl>, I<setup-hotkeys.py> "
"and the helper modules, as well as the shipped I<zones.conf>."
msgstr ""
"软件包代码：I<zone-tiler.py>、I<zone-daemon.py>、I<zone-editor.py>、I<zone-"
"picker.py>、I<zone-tabstrip.py>、I<gridsnap-ctl>、I<setup-hotkeys.py> 及辅助"
"模块，还有随包提供的 I<zones.conf>。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:753
#, no-wrap
msgid "I</usr/bin/gridsnap-tiler>"
msgstr "I</usr/bin/gridsnap-tiler>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:758
msgid ""
"The command launchers (I<gridsnap-tiler>, I<gridsnap-daemon>, I<gridsnap-"
"editor>, I<gridsnap-picker>, I<gridsnap-ctl>, I<setup-hotkeys>) — wrappers "
"around the code in I</usr/lib/gridsnap>."
msgstr ""
"命令启动器（I<gridsnap-tiler>、I<gridsnap-daemon>、I<gridsnap-editor>、"
"I<gridsnap-picker>、I<gridsnap-ctl>、I<setup-hotkeys>）——对 I</usr/lib/"
"gridsnap> 中代码的包装。"

#. type: SH
#: man/gridsnap.1:758
#, no-wrap
msgid "EXIT STATUS"
msgstr "退出码"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:759
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<0>"
msgstr "B<0>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:763
msgid ""
"Success. B<arrange> and B<stack> with no suitable windows and B<undo> with "
"an empty history are 0 too."
msgstr ""
"成功。B<arrange> 和 B<stack> 没有合适的窗口、B<undo> 历史为空时也是 0。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:763
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<1>"
msgstr "B<1>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:769
msgid ""
"A runtime error: no display or no active window, I<_NET_CLIENT_LIST> not "
"read, the IPC socket could not be raised (daemon), no connection to the "
"daemon or the command was refused (B<gridsnap-ctl>), a B<gsettings>(1) error "
"(B<setup-hotkeys>)."
msgstr ""
"执行错误：没有显示或活动窗口、I<_NET_CLIENT_LIST> 读取失败、IPC 套接字无法启"
"动（守护进程）、与守护进程失联或命令被拒（B<gridsnap-ctl>）、B<gsettings>(1) "
"出错（B<setup-hotkeys>）。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:769
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<2>"
msgstr "B<2>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:773
msgid ""
"An argument error: an unknown command or zone, a bad profile name, a wrong "
"flag.  It is reported by B<argparse> or by the command itself."
msgstr ""
"参数错误：未知的命令或区域、不合法的方案名、错误的标志。由 B<argparse> 或命令"
"自己报告。"

#. type: TP
#: man/gridsnap.1:773
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<3>"
msgstr "B<3>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:779
msgid ""
"A config error: the file is missing, there is no zone at all, broken "
"numbers, fractions outside 0..1, a rule for an unknown zone, a missing or "
"broken profile. B<gridsnap-tiler> and B<gridsnap-daemon> answer like this; "
"B<gridsnap-picker> exits with code 1 in the same cases."
msgstr ""
"配置错误：文件不存在、一个区域都没有、数字写错、比例超出 0..1、规则指向未知区"
"域、方案缺失或损坏。这样回答的是 B<gridsnap-tiler> 和 B<gridsnap-daemon>；"
"B<gridsnap-picker> 在同样情况下以返回码 1 退出。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:783
msgid ""
"B<gridsnap-ctl> has codes 0, 1 and 2; B<gridsnap-daemon> — 0, 1 (socket) and "
"3 (config); B<gridsnap-editor> and B<gridsnap-picker> — 0 and 1 (plus 2 from "
"B<argparse>); B<setup-hotkeys> — 0, 1 and 2."
msgstr ""
"B<gridsnap-ctl> 的返回码是 0、1 和 2；B<gridsnap-daemon> 是 0、1（套接字）和 "
"3（配置）；B<gridsnap-editor> 和 B<gridsnap-picker> 是 0 和 1（另有 "
"B<argparse> 的 2）；B<setup-hotkeys> 是 0、1 和 2。"

#. type: SH
#: man/gridsnap.1:783
#, no-wrap
msgid "SEE ALSO"
msgstr "另见"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:788
msgid ""
"B<gridsnap-tiler>(1), B<gridsnap-daemon>(1), B<gridsnap-editor>(1), "
"B<gridsnap-picker>(1), B<gridsnap-hotcorners>(1), B<gridsnap-ctl>(1), "
"B<setup-hotkeys>(1), B<man>(1), B<xprop>(1), B<xwininfo>(1), B<gsettings>(1)."
msgstr ""
"B<gridsnap-tiler>(1)、B<gridsnap-daemon>(1)、B<gridsnap-editor>(1)、"
"B<gridsnap-picker>(1)、B<gridsnap-hotcorners>(1)、B<gridsnap-ctl>(1)、"
"B<setup-hotkeys>(1)、B<man>(1)、B<xprop>(1)、B<xwininfo>(1)、"
"B<gsettings>(1)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/gridsnap.1:790
msgid ""
"The package documentation is in I</usr/share/doc/gridsnap/> (README, SPEC "
"and I<docs/>)."
msgstr "软件包文档在 I</usr/share/doc/gridsnap/>（README、SPEC 和 I<docs/>）。"
